</details>

--- 0b75c9a3-94a0-8946-8b50-e001e23974c8
claude-opus-4-7 — Fri 18 Apr 2369 09:00

Sustained warp 9.2 is the rated ceiling; the nacelles tolerate 9.6 for about twelve hours before the coils need a full recalibration.

**Sources**

1. Warp factor — Memory Alpha
2. Galaxy class propulsion — Starfleet Technical Manual
3. Warp coil — Memory Alpha

--- 0b75c9a4-30e0-8afe-869a-f421df2f8c6a
